  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now, finding the point of intersection of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo> </mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≡</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>And point of intersection of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo> </mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math> will be, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≡</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, plotting the diagramw we get,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0051_091f74fef359.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 275px;\"/></p><p>Now, from the above diagram, the required area will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>8</mn></msubsup><mfrac><msqrt><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><m